ack the same answer. So that's correct.\n\nI think that's it. The area of the rectangle is 196 square inches.\n</think>\n\nTo find the area of the rectangle, we begin by using the dimensions provided:\n\n- Width = 7 inches  \n- Length = 4 × Width = $4 \\times 7 = 28$ inches  \n\nThe area $A$ of a rectangle is given by the formula:  \n$$\nA = \\text{length} \\times \\text{width}\n$$  \n\nSubstituting the values:  \n$$\nA = 28 \\times 7 = 196\n$$  \n\nThus, the area of the rectangle is $ \\boxed{196} $.<|im_end|>", "source_record": {"question": "You draw a rectangle that is 7 inches wide. It is 4 times as long as it is wide. What is the area of the rectangle?", "answer": "The length of the rectangle is 4 * 7 inches = <<4*7=28>>28 inches.\nThe area of the rectangle is 7 inches * 28 inches = <<7*28=196>>196 square inches.\n#### 196", "prompt": "Solve the following grade-school math problem. Show your reasoning and put the final answer in \\boxed{}.\n\nProblem: You draw a rectangle that is 7 inches wide. It is 4 times as long as it is wide. What is the area of the rectangle?\nSolution:", "solutions": ["196"], "solution": "196"}, "prompt_tokens": [151644, 872, 198, 50, 3948, 279, 2701, 11972, 34689, 6888, 3491, 13, 6928, 697, 32711, 323, 2182, 279, 1590, 4226, 304, 1124, 79075, 6257, 382, 31198, 25, 1446, 4038, 264, 22756, 429, 374, 220, 22, 14924, 6884, 13, 1084, 374, 220, 19, 3039, 438, 1293, 438, 432, 374, 6884, 13, 3555, 374, 279, 3082, 315, 279, 22756, 5267, 36842, 25, 151645, 198, 151644, 77091], "response_tokens": [151667, 198, 32313, 11, 773, 358, 1184, 311, 1477, 279, 3082, 315, 264, 22756, 13, 6771, 752, 1744, 13, 576, 3491, 2727, 279, 22756, 374, 220, 22, 14924, 6884, 323, 432, 594, 220, 19, 3039, 438, 1293, 438, 432, 374, 6884, 13, 88190, 11, 1077, 752, 1438, 419, 1495, 382, 5338, 11, 979, 807, 1977, 432, 594, 220, 22, 14924, 6884, 11, 429, 594]}
